# and private project topology). Keep on disk for local agents; never track.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
*.local.md
plans/
TODOS.md

# Failed visual-regression runs write candidate renders next to the baselines.
# They are review artifacts, never content to commit.
tests/e2e/baselines/*.actual.png
